WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.943
Your pull request changes what people see.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.257
But your reviewer gets a diff, and has to imagine the rest.

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:11.702
So ask your coding agent to SideShot it. One sentence.

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:20.794
It pictures the part that changed, before and after, on a desk and a phone, in light and dark.

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:25.128
Then it rings what you meant to change, and marks everything else that did.

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:31.331
And it puts the table in your pull request, so your reviewer sees the change instead of imagining it.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:35.257
SideShot. See the change, side by side.
